      Lederberg EXVC029P, Isolated from Devil's Hole, Bermuda.
LID - 10.1128/MRA.01325-20 [doi]
LID - e01325-20
AB  - We present the genomes of two isolated bacteriophages infecting Pelagibacter 
      ubique HTCC1062. Pelagibacter phage Mosig EXVC030M (Myoviridae) and Pelagibacter 
      phage Lederberg EXVC029P (Podoviridae) were isolated by dilution-to-extinction 
      culturing from the oxygen minimum zone at Devil's Hole (Harrington Sound, 
      Bermuda).
