TI  - Complete genome sequence of strain IMCC9063, belonging to SAR11 subgroup 3, 
      isolated from the Arctic Ocean.
PG  - 3379-80
LID - 10.1128/JB.05033-11 [doi]
AB  - Strain IMCC9063 is a novel isolate of the SAR11 clade and is distantly related to 
      other cultured representatives in this clade. The strain was isolated off the 
      coast of Svalbard, Norway, by applying high-throughput culturing methods based on 
      dilution to extinction. Here we present the finished genome sequence of strain 
      IMCC9063.
